    <string name="converter_title">Convert to hc22000</string>
    <string name="converter_short_description">Converts CAP/PCAP to hc22000 for use with Hashcat on a PC.</string>
    <string name="converter_description">Supports standard airodump-ng libpcap captures with 802.11 or Radiotap frames. The converter creates WPA*02 records for M1+M2 pairs with matching replay counters.</string>
    <string name="converter_info">Converts supported CAP/PCAP captures into hc22000 text records suitable for Hashcat on desktop systems. The converter searches for usable WPA handshakes and writes WPA*02 records when matching data is available.</string>
    <string name="converter_usage_notice_title">CAP on Android</string>
    <string name="converter_usage_notice">This converter is mainly useful when you need an hc22000 file for Hashcat on a PC. The Android Hashcat in this app can load supported CAP/PCAP files directly from the main screen, so conversion is not required before running Hashcat here.</string>
